#: ../../appendix-02-glossary.md:31 c8452bf3e14145c1a098a8e42e515e8b
msgid ""
"Terms used across this knowledge base. DNS definitions match nginx 1.31.1 in"
" this tree; Lua/LuaJIT definitions follow the [Lua and LuaJIT "
"appendix](appendix-03-lua.md) and the [lua-nginx-module reference](08-lua-"
"nginx-module.md)."
msgstr ""
"本知识库通用的术语。DNS 定义以本源码树中的 nginx 1.31.1 为准；Lua/LuaJIT 定义遵循[附录 Lua 与 "
"LuaJIT](appendix-03-lua.md)和 [lua-nginx-module 参考](08-lua-nginx-module.md)。"

#: ../../appendix-02-glossary.md:35 b82547101ac748b3aac6a2b1db85847e
msgid "Terms"
